---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { STICKY_DUBAI_OFFPLAN } from '../../data/sticky-cta';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Dubai Off-Plan Investment: Escrow-Verified Project Shortlist"
  description="Off-plan Dubai property shortlist with RERA escrow checks, payment plan comparison, and developer due diligence. Independent research for foreign buyers."
  stickyCta={STICKY_DUBAI_OFFPLAN}
>
  <section class="site-container py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <span class="badge-pill mb-4">Off-plan</span>
      <h1 class="mb-4">Dubai off-plan investment</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-muted)]">
        Roughly 60 to 70% of Dubai sales are off-plan. We filter projects by escrow status, developer delivery record, and post-handover payment flexibility.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5">
        <a href="#lead-form" class="btn-primary">See escrow-checked projects</a>
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose mb-10">
      <p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Off-plan purchases register on Oqood with 4% DLD paid at SPA stage. Funds sit in DLD-regulated escrow until construction milestones. Compare payment plans (60/40, post-handover) against lost rental income during build.</p>
      <p>Read: <a href="/guides/off-plan-property-dubai-guide/">Off-plan Dubai guide</a> · <a href="/guides/off-plan-payment-plans-dubai/">Payment plans</a> · <a href="/guides/how-to-evaluate-dubai-developer/">Evaluate developers</a></p>
      <p>Weighing markets: <a href="/gcc-rental-yields/">GCC rental yields hub</a> · <a href="/invest-dubai-property/">ready Dubai stock</a></p>
    </div>
    <LeadForm title="Off-plan project shortlist" subtitle="Developer tier · payment plan · area" context="Invest Dubai off-plan landing" />
    <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mt-6">Verify escrow on Dubai REST before any payment. Not investment advice.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
